{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":11,"ref":"numbers 18:11","book":"numbers","lang":"de","chapter":18,"translation":"Und dies soll dir gehören: die Teruma ihrer Gaben, zu allen Schwingopfern der Söhne Jisraels — dir habe ich sie gegeben und deinen Söhnen und deinen Töchtern ⟨את⟩ bei dir, als ewige Ordnung. Jeder Reine in deinem Haus darf ⟨es⟩ essen.","tokens":[{"surface":"וזה","gloss":"Und dies"},{"surface":"לך","gloss":"dir"},{"surface":"תרומת","gloss":"die Teruma"},{"surface":"מתנם","gloss":"ihrer Gaben"},{"surface":"לכל","gloss":"zu allen"},{"surface":"תנופת","gloss":"Schwingopfern"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"der Söhne"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"Jisraels"},{"surface":"לך","gloss":"dir"},{"surface":"נתתים","gloss":"habe ich sie gegeben"},{"surface":"ולבניך","gloss":"und deinen Söhnen"},{"surface":"ולבנתיך","gloss":"und deinen Töchtern"},{"surface":"אתך","gloss":"⟨את⟩ bei dir"},{"surface":"לחק","gloss":"als Ordnung"},{"surface":"עולם","gloss":"ewige"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"Jeder"},{"surface":"טהור","gloss":"Reine"},{"surface":"בביתך","gloss":"in deinem Haus"},{"surface":"יאכל","gloss":"darf essen"},{"surface":"אתו","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"es (die Gaben)"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-24T21:30:50.245121100Z","model":"glm-5.2"}